sonline.com/blogs/spin-wheel-birthday-party-ideas#breadcrumbs\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n      \"@id\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/blogs/spin-wheel-birthday-party-ideas#breadcrumbs\",\n      \"itemListElement\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 1,\n          \"name\": \"Home\",\n          \"item\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 2,\n          \"name\": \"Blog\",\n          \"item\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/blogs\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 3,\n          \"name\": \"Spin Wheel Birthday Party Ideas\",\n          \"item\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/blogs/spin-wheel-birthday-party-ideas\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\",\n      \"@id\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/blogs/spin-wheel-birthday-party-ideas#article\",\n      \"headline\": \"25+ Spin the Wheel Games for Birthdays and Baby Showers\",\n      \"description\": \"Ready-to-copy spin the wheel games for birthday parties and baby showers, with exact segment lists for prize wheels, dares, trivia, and gender reveals.\",\n      \"image\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/eng-truth-picker-wheel.webp\",\n      \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-15\",\n      \"dateModified\": \"2026-11-24\",\n      \"inLanguage\": \"en\",\n      \"author\": {\n        \"@id\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/#harman\"\n      },\n      \"publisher\": {\n        \"@id\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/#organization\"\n      },\n      \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\n        \"@id\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/blogs/spin-wheel-birthday-party-ideas#webpage\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n      \"@id\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/blogs/spin-wheel-birthday-party-ideas#faq\",\n      \"mainEntity\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What age group does a birthday party wheel work best for?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"It works across nearly every age when the entries match the crowd—physical actions for under-6s, light trivia and silly dares for kids 7–12, creative challenges for teens, and prize or karaoke trivia wheels for adult parties.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"How many segments should a party wheel have?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"8 to 12 segments is ideal for most party rounds so every slice stays readable from across a room and lands regularly without getting repetitive.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Can a spin wheel be used at an outdoor party?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Yes — it runs in any mobile or tablet browser, pairs cleanly with a Bluetooth speaker for sound effects, and once loaded keeps spinning locally even if yard Wi-Fi drops.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Can I customize slice colors or weights for a gender reveal or party theme?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Yes — switch between 8 visual color themes (Pastel Dream, Candy Pop, Neon, Classic) and adjust spin duration anywhere from 2s to 20s in Settings.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What if the same dare or trivia question comes up twice?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Toggle Remove Winner After Spin in Settings so each landed question or dare leaves the wheel automatically for the