                seven-year-old and a grandparent grasp it at the same speed.
                There's no rulebook, no "wait, how do we win?" moment slowing
                the room down.</span
              >
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="uc-icon purple">🖥️</div>
            <div class="uc-body">
