        <h2 id="birthday-prizes">2. Birthday Prize Wheel Walkthrough</h2>
        <div class="party-label">🎂 Birthday Party</div>

        <p>
          Think of a prize wheel as a digital lucky dip — chance turns even a
          modest prize into something that feels earned. Getting the balance
          right, though, takes a bit more thought than just listing whatever you
          have on hand.
        </p>

        <h3>Balancing your prize tiers</h3>
        <p>
          The trick is spreading value across segments so the big prize doesn't
          go in the first five minutes and the smaller ones still feel worth
          winning. A distribution that tends to work well:
        </p>

        <div class="box box-purple">
          <div class="box-label">🎡 A Balanced Prize Tier Layout</div>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <strong>One headline prize:</strong> a single segment — gift card,
              larger toy, an experience voucher
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Two or three mid-tier prizes:</strong> smaller gifts,
              activity kits, a sweets box
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Four or five small "fun" prizes:</strong> stickers,
              bubbles, a chocolate bar, temporary tattoos
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Two or three "spin again" segments:</strong> keeps
              engagement up without burning through your prize stock
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Two or three silly forfeit segments:</strong> free,
              entertaining, no prize budget needed — e.g. "Do your best robot
              dance!"
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <h3>For younger guests (roughly ages 4–10)</h3>
        <p>Segment ideas that reliably land well with this age group:</p>
        <div class="pill-list">
          <span class="pill pill-pink">🍬 Sweets bag</span>
          <span class="pill pill-purple">🫧 Bubble wand</span>
          <span class="pill pill-pink">🖍️ Colouring set</span>
          <span class="pill pill-gold">🏅 Gold sticker badge</span>
          <span class="pill pill-teal">🎈 Choose your balloon colour</span>
          <span class="pill pill-green">🎉 Spin again!</span>
          <span class="pill pill-pink">🦄 Mini figure</span>
          <span class="pill pill-purple">💃 Silly dance for 10 seconds</span>
          <span class="pill pill-gold">🍰 Extra piece of cake</span>
          <span class="pill pill-teal">📸 Pose for a photo!</span>
        </div>

        <h3>For adult birthdays (21st, 30th, 40th and beyond)</h3>
        <p>
          Swap physical prizes for small moments and light humour — it tends to
          land better with a mixed adult crowd:
        </p>
        <div class="pill-list">
          <span class="pill pill-purple">🍸 Free cocktail</span>
          <span class="pill pill-pink">🎁 Mystery prize envelope</span>
          <span class="pill pill-gold"
