          >
          <span class="pill pill-pink">🥂 Everyone cheers for you</span>
          <span class="pill pill-purple">🔄 Pass the spin to anyone</span>
          <span class="pill pill-gold">🍕 First pick at the food table</span>
          <span class="pill pill-teal">💌 Read a secret compliment card</span>
          <span class="pill pill-pink">🎊 Spin again!</span>
